WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.375 --> 00:00:02.958
Unit four. Sleep Time!

2
00:00:03.929 --> 00:00:07.693
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.743 --> 00:00:11.070
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:14.490
Today we learn about Sleep Time. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.418 --> 00:00:18.568
Bed. Say it with me. Bed!

6
00:00:22.051 --> 00:00:25.351
Pillow. Say it with me. Pillow!

7
00:00:28.857 --> 00:00:32.091
Night. Say it with me. Night!

8
00:00:35.587 --> 00:00:39.003
Rest. Say it with me. Rest!

9
00:00:42.507 --> 00:00:45.740
Dream. Say it with me. Dream!

10
00:00:49.236 --> 00:00:52.586
Tired. Say it with me. Tired!

11
00:00:56.102 --> 00:00:59.652
Early. Say it with me. Early!

12
00:01:03.152 --> 00:01:06.385
Quiet. Say it with me. Quiet!

13
00:01:09.882 --> 00:01:18.798
I go to bed early every night and rest on my soft pillow. Sleep helps my body grow, and sometimes I have a nice dream. A quiet room helps me sleep well.

14
00:01:18.848 --> 00:01:20.024
I can do that too!

15
00:01:21.241 --> 00:01:26.491
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:26.541 --> 00:01:27.691
Night!

17
00:01:28.508 --> 00:01:33.796
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:33.846 --> 00:01:34.996
Early!

19
00:01:35.870 --> 00:01:42.326
Did you know? Children your age need about 9 to 12 hours of sleep every night to grow strong!

20
00:01:42.376 --> 00:01:44.334
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:45.025 --> 00:01:52.864
Think and answer. Why do you think sleep is important for children?

22
00:01:52.914 --> 00:01:54.064
Great answer!

23
00:01:55.186 --> 00:02:00.093
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:00.143 --> 00:02:02.879
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

